<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>68.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_Match_Found</name>
        <label>Assign Match Found</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>$Record.AF_ExistingAccountMatch__c</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <name>Has_Match</name>
        <label>Has Match?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Match_Found</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Find_Matching_Account</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Find_Open_SameBrand_Opportunity</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Match Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Has_Open_SameBrand_Opportunity</name>
        <label>Has Open Same-Brand Opportunity?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Open_SameBrand_Opportunity_Found</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Find_Open_SameBrand_Opportunity</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Assign_Match_Found</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Open Same-Brand Opportunity Found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Deterministic replacement for the native DuplicateRule-based Account block: Salesforce only evaluates one DuplicateRule match per save, so when a Lead also soft-matched another Lead/Contact via the Standard_Lead_Duplicate_Rule, the Account-block rule silently never fired regardless of sortOrder. This before-save flow always runs (order of execution guarantees before-save flows run before validation rules and before duplicate rules), so it can&apos;t be shadowed the way the native rule was.

SCOPED 2026-08-27 (BRD 8.9 AC3 conflict): only blocks when the matching Account already has an OPEN Opportunity for the SAME Brand — not on every phone match. Originally blocked unconditionally, which broke 8.9 AC3 (a repeat customer engaging a different BU/brand must still be able to create a new Lead so the existing Account gets reused at conversion, not rejected at intake). A genuinely duplicate same-brand inquiry is still blocked.

FIXED 2026-08-27: Find_Matching_Account only ever filtered on Phone — a Lead whose Qatar ID matched an existing Account&apos;s AF_QID__c (with a different or blank Phone) was never caught, so the block silently never fired for QID-only matches. Added AF_QID__c to the match (OR logic against Phone), using the same blank-safe sentinel-formula pattern already used in AF_FL_Lead_ShortWindowGuard: each side substitutes a literal placeholder string when the Lead&apos;s own value is blank, so a blank Lead field can never falsely match a blank/null Account field.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_PhoneMatchValue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.Phone}), &quot;___AF_NO_PHONE___&quot;, {!$Record.Phone})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_QIDMatchValue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.AF_QID__c}), &quot;___AF_NO_QID___&quot;, {!$Record.AF_QID__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>AF Lead Check Account Match {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Lead Check Account Match</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Find_Matching_Account</name>
        <label>Find Matching Account</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Has_Match</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>or</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Phone</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>AF_Formula_PhoneMatchValue</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>AF_QID__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>AF_Formula_QIDMatchValue</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Account</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Find_Open_SameBrand_Opportunity</name>
        <label>Find Open Same-Brand Opportunity</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Has_Open_SameBrand_Opportunity</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>AccountId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Find_Matching_Account.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>AF_Brand__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.AF_Brand__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>StageName</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Closed Won</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>StageName</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Closed Lost</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <runInMode>SystemModeWithoutSharing</runInMode>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Find_Matching_Account</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterFormula>AND(OR(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Phone})), NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.AF_QID__c}))), NOT({!$Record.IsConverted}))</filterFormula>
        <object>Lead</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Create</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <triggerOrder>5</triggerOrder>
</Flow>
